# ==============================================================================
# ATELIER CV — Authentication & Cloud Sync Configuration (100% Free Tier)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Create a free Supabase project at https://supabase.com
#    (Free plan includes: 50,000 monthly active users, Google OAuth, email verification)
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API, and copy the Project URL and Anon Key below:
# 3. Rename this file to .env.local for local development, or add these variables
#    to your Vercel deployment under Project Settings -> Environment Variables.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Optional: To enable Google OAuth in Supabase:
# - Go to Authentication -> Providers -> Google in your Supabase dashboard
# - Add your Google Cloud Console Client ID and Client Secret
# - Set Authorized Redirect URI in Google Cloud to:
#   https://<your-supabase-project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
